      "text": ["The first release:", "Kode9 & The Spaceape.", "\"Sine of the Dub.\" 2004.", "A dubstep rework of a Prince song.", "Around the same time,", "someone began mailing him homemade CD-Rs.", "No name. Just music."],
      "sub": "An anonymous tape in the post."
